{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cacti/cacti/pulls/9015","id":5535209490,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAcF0qc8AAAABSeyYEg","html_url":"https://github.com/Cacti/cacti/pull/9015","diff_url":"https://github.com/Cacti/cacti/pull/9015.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Cacti/cacti/pull/9015.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cacti/cacti/issues/9015","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cacti/cacti/pulls/9015/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cacti/cacti/pulls/9015/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cacti/cacti/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cacti/cacti/issues/9015/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cacti/cacti/statuses/d2d9a722f41b4975dc49465699e1cf84e57d828c","number":9015,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(security): [develop] harden user settings validation, Guest writes, and realtime graph access","user":{"login":"somethingwithproof","id":341181,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTE4MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/341181?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/somethingwithproof","html_url":"https://github.com/somethingwithproof","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somethingwithproof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somethingwithproof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somethingwithproof/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somethingwithproof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somethingwithproof/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somethingwithproof/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somethingwithproof/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somethingwithproof/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/somethingwithproof/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nHardens user-preference validation, Guest account write restrictions, tree pagination bounds, and realtime graph access control on `develop` (companion to the `1.2.x` security hardening PR; leaves `lib/html_graph.php` untouched since `ae54a2a55` already validates preview pagination on `develop`).\n\n### Changes\n\n- **User-setting schema validation (`lib/user_setting_validation.php`, `auth_profile.php`, `lib/functions.php`)**:\n  - Adds PHP 8.3-typed schema validation against `$settings_user` field definitions (`checkbox`, `drop_array`, `themes`, `drop_language`, `drop_sql`, `drop_color`, numeric/time `textbox`, and `font`) plus Guest-account and numeric/interval sanitization helpers.\n  - Enforces `auth_profile_require_post()` on `save` and `update_data`.\n  - Denies Guest account writes with HTTP 403 across profile and 2FA mutation handlers (`save`, `logout_everywhere`, `clear_user_settings`, `reset_default`, `update_data`, `disable_2fa`, `enable_2fa`, `verify_2fa`) and returns early in `save_user_settings()`.\n  - Enforces `is_view_allowed('graph_settings')` and schema validation (HTTP 400 on invalid values) in `api_auth_update_user_setting()`.\n- **Tree pagination and numeric settings (`lib/html_tree.php`)**:\n  - Validates and clamps `$graph_rows` (`treeview_graphs_per_page` / `graphs`) as a bounded positive integer.\n  - Casts `min_tree_width`, `max_tree_width`, and `page_refresh` to bounded integers before `<script>` output.\n- **Realtime graph authorization and argument hardening (`graph_realtime.php`)**:\n  - Enforces `is_graph_allowed($local_graph_id)` returning HTTP 403 before invoking `shell_exec()` and before reading cached files in `case 'view'`.\n  - Anchors `graph_nolegend` validation to `/^(true|false)$/`.\n  - Clamps `ds_step` via `cacti_sanitize_realtime_interval()` and blocks Guest writes to `set_user_setting()`.\n- **Regression tests (`tests/Unit/Security/InputValidation/UserSettingsAndRealtimeHardeningTest.php`)**:\n  - Covers Guest detection, schema validation across field methods, numeric/interval sanitizers, and source-level guard assertions.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `php -l` passed on all 6 modified/added files.\n- Pest (`tests/Unit/Security/InputValidation/UserSettingsAndRealtimeHardeningTest.php`): 4 passed (48 assertions).\n- PHPStan: 0 errors across all 5 modified/added production files.\n- `php-cs-fixer --dry-run`: 0 of 6 files need formatting changes.\n- `tests/tools/check_hardening_patterns.php`, `tests/security/verify_sink_inventory.sh`, and `tests/security/verify_architectural_hotspots.sh`: all passed.\n- Commit is DCO-signed and GPG-signed.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-28T01:06:08Z","updated_at":"2026-11-28T01:24:05Z","closed_at":"2026-11-28T01:24:05Z","merged_at":"2026-11-28T01:24:05Z","merge_commit_sha":"e23470d817222387f3f41139e014ad21135b171e","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"cigamit","id":957322,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NzMyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/957322?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cigamit","html_url":"https://github.com/cigamit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cigamit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cigamit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cigamit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cigamit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cigamit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cigamit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cigamit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cigamit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cigamit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"somethingwithproof:fix/sec-user-settings-realtime-develop","ref":"fix/sec-user-s